d Area I in yellow.)</p>","updateDate":"2025-12-09T13:36:37Z","versionCode":"07"}],"title":"World War II Women's Memorial Location Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-08T18:09:59Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-08T18:09:59Z"}
